uke makes numerous surprise attacks on the devil before finally overcoming him, and using a horn of plenty left behind by the devil, he ends up a strapping young man.<br><br>\n(Source: Digital Meme)", "startDate": {"year": 1935, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 1935, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 9, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action"], "tags": [{"name": "Swordplay", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Achromatic", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 6837, "title": {"romaji": "Tengu Taiji", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "A short film from 1934.", "startDate": {"year": 1934, "month": 6}, "endDate": {"year": 1934, "month": 6}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 8, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy"], "tags": []}, {"id": 6838, "title": {"romaji": "Dekobou no Jidousha Ryokou", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "A man encounters strange animals during his road trip in his car. Short film from 1934.", "startDate": {"year": 1934, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 1934, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 1, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Adventure"], "tags": [{"name": "Cars", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Achromatic", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Animals", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 6839, "title": {"romaji": "Hinomaru Tarou: Musha Shugyou no Maki", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "The hero Taro attempts to rescue a kidnapped girl from a bandit.  Short film from 1936.", "startDate": {"year": 1936, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 1936, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 5, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action"], "tags